{"text":"MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "Echo Flex feels like a useful next choice because it would extend Alexa access to another room without using counter space.",
    "The Blink options connect my earlier interest in a door alarm with my recent Alexa devices, giving me a new home-monitoring use rather than another similar speaker."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "More Fire TV sticks offer little immediate value after my recent 4K Max bundle interaction; the themed remote cover does not add a benefit I have shown interest in.",
    "Older Echo Dot and Show 5 models feel less relevant after my recent interactions with newer versions, especially the stand that fits my second-generation Show 5."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "My interest in Alexa devices seems to have been taken as a reason to suggest almost any Echo, even when it repeats a function I recently explored.",
    "My Fire TV interaction seems to have been interpreted as wanting more streaming sticks, although closely related versions do not meet a new need."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "The timing and specific versions of my recent interactions matter: a newer device followed by a matching accessory makes an older replacement less appealing.",
    "I care about what an additional device would let me do. Home monitoring or Alexa access in another room is more compelling now than another similar display or speaker, and I would explore the Blink bundle before choosing a separate doorbell."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The recommendations recognize my interest in Alexa, but often confuse extending its usefulness with repeating devices I recently explored."
}"}
